Scoped colorkey and colorhold video filters

The option tables, the shared pixel_fmts list, the eight-bit key distance and
soft blend arithmetic, the alpha write and the gray hold rounding in
src/video-colorkey.ts, src/video-ops/colorkey.ts and src/video-ops/colorhold.ts
follow libavfilter/vf_colorkey.c (colorkey_options, colorhold_options,
pixel_fmts, do_colorkey_pixel, COLORKEY_SLICE, COLORHOLD_SLICE, config_output,
filter_frame). The color option is parsed by the shared av_parse_color port
(@edge-ffmpeg/avutil parseColor).
